  "claim": "In the Glee episode \"Bad Reputation,\" Sue Sylvester dances to the song Physical, by a four-time Grammy winner and star of musical film \"Grease.\".",
  "evidencia": "Page: Bad Reputation (Glee). Sentence: \"Bad Reputation\" is the seventeenth episode of the American television series, \"Glee\".\nPage: Bad Reputation (Glee). Sentence: In \"Bad Reputation\", cheerleading coach Sue Sylvester (Jane Lynch) is publicly ridiculed when a video of her dancing to Olivia Newton-John's \"Physical\" is posted on YouTube.\nPage: Olivia Newton-John. Sentence: She is a four-time Grammy award winner who has amassed five number-one and ten other top ten \"Billboard\" Hot 100 singles, and two number-one \"Billboard\" 200 solo albums.\nPage: Olivia Newton-John. Sentence: She starred in the musical film \"Grease\", and is one of the most successful in history, with the single You're the One That I Want, with John Travolta, one of the best selling singles.",
