        "original_id": "a9634dab-2d31-584a-9ce4-90f15068d859",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Bad Reputation, Glee, Physical, Grease, You're the One That I Want\n- People: Sue Sylvester, Jane Lynch, Olivia Newton-John, John Travolta\n- Topics: television episodes, YouTube, music awards, Billboard charts\n\nFacts:\n- \"Bad Reputation\" is the seventeenth episode of the American television series \"Glee.\"\n- In \"Bad Reputation,\" Sue Sylvester, played by Jane Lynch, is publicly ridiculed when a video of her dancing to Olivia Newton-John's \"Physical\" is posted on YouTube.\n- Olivia Newton-John is a four-time Grammy Award winner.\n- Olivia Newton-John amassed five number-one Billboard Hot 100 singles, ten other top ten Billboard Hot 100 singles, and two number-one Billboard 200 solo albums.\n- Olivia Newton-John starred in the musical film \"Grease.\"\n- Olivia Newton-John and John Travolta performed \"You're the One That I Want,\" which is described as one of the best-selling singles in history.",
